    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 0.68,
      "end": 16.208,
      "narration": "24座冠军，23座城市。从悉尼的生涯首冠，到纽约的大满贯之巅，再到杭州捧杯，梅德韦杰夫把冠军足迹，留在了世界各地。网球界的Mr.Worldwide，他当之无愧。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 16.208,
      "end": 16.56,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 16.56,
      "end": 19.48,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 19.48,
      "end": 24.208,
      "narration": "从资格赛突围，二十一岁在悉尼捧起生涯首冠。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 24.208,
      "end": 34.76,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 34.76,
      "end": 43.508,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 43.508,
      "end": 47.78,
      "narration": "六场比赛一盘未失，第二冠在美网前到手。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 47.78,
      "end": 48.08,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 48.08,
      "end": 53.286,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 53.286,
      "end": 58.11,
      "narration": "从资格赛打到冠军，东京送来首座五百赛奖杯。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 58.11,
      "end": 58.4,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 58.4,
      "end": 58.52,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 58.52,
      "end": 63.056,
      "narration": "逆转首战险关，索非亚开启赛季冠军账户。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 63.056,
      "end": 70.8,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 70.8,
      "end": 77.66,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 77.66,
      "end": 81.932,
      "narration": "逆转德约后，辛辛那提成为他的大师赛首冠。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 81.932,
      "end": 82.32,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 82.32,
      "end": 87.372,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 87.372,
      "end": 91.5,
      "narration": "美网惜败两周后，他在祖国首次捧杯。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 91.5,
      "end": 91.8,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 91.8,
      "end": 96.984,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 96.984,
      "end": 101.88,
      "narration": "连续第六站闯入决赛，上海再添大师赛冠军。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 101.88,
      "end": 102.16,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 102.16,
      "end": 108.71,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 108.71,
      "end": 112.79,
      "narration": "先丢一盘再逆转，巴黎带来赛季首冠。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 112.79,
      "end": 113.08,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 113.08,
      "end": 121.25,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 121.25,
      "end": 129.41,
      "narration": "在伦敦，他把世界前三全部击败。五战全胜，拿下职业生涯首座年终总决赛冠军。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 129.41,
      "end": 129.68,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 129.68,
      "end": 134.96,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 134.96,
      "end": 139.544,
      "narration": "鏖战三盘拿下第十冠，次日他升至世界第二。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 139.544,
      "end": 139.84,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 139.84,
      "end": 145.65,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 145.65,
      "end": 149.97,
      "narration": "十座硬地冠军之后，马略卡带来草地首冠。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 149.97,
      "end": 150.24,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 150.24,
      "end": 156.614,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 156.614,
      "end": 161.27,
      "narration": "击退两门发球重炮，多伦多带来大师赛第四冠。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 161.27,
      "end": 161.56,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 161.56,
      "end": 169.082,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 169.082,
      "end": 177.074,
      "narration": "直落三盘击败德约科维奇，终结对手的年度全满贯冲刺。纽约，迎来他的首座大满贯。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 177.074,
      "end": 177.36,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 177.36,
      "end": 181.326,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 181.326,
      "end": 185.19,
      "narration": "洛斯卡沃斯，这是登上世界第一后的首冠。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 185.19,
      "end": 185.48,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 185.48,
      "end": 188.4,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 188.4,
      "end": 192.552,
      "narration": "刚锁定年终席位，又在维也纳逆转夺冠。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 192.552,
      "end": 216.44,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 216.44,
      "end": 220.906,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 220.906,
      "end": 224.17,
      "narration": "逆转辛纳，开启三周三冠。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 224.17,
      "end": 224.44,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 224.44,
      "end": 227.36,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 227.36,
      "end": 232.088,
      "narration": "首次来到多哈就击败穆雷，连冠脚步走进中东。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 232.088,
      "end": 255.56,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 255.56,
      "end": 261.514,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 261.514,
      "end": 266.29,
      "narration": "连胜德约和卢布列夫，三周三冠在迪拜完成。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 266.29,
      "end": 266.56,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 266.56,
      "end": 271.16,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 271.16,
      "end": 275.84,
      "narration": "五站决赛四座奖杯，迈阿密见证这个强势春天。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 275.84,
      "end": 276.12,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 276.12,
      "end": 276.84,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 276.84,
      "end": 282.744,
      "narration": "此前罗马一胜难求。这一次，他终于捧起首座红土奖杯。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 282.744,
      "end": 296.28,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 296.28,
      "end": 298.2,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 298.2,
      "end": 302.52,
      "narration": "苦战三盘，结束八百八十二天冠军荒。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 302.52,
      "end": 322.36,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 322.36,
      "end": 324.28,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 324.28,
      "end": 328.816,
      "narration": "七年前的亚军，在布里斯班等来了冠军开场。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 328.816,
      "end": 337.24,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 337.24,
      "end": 338.602,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 338.602,
      "end": 343.57,
      "narration": "对手赛前伤退，迪拜成为他首个两度捧杯的地方。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 343.57,
      "end": 343.84,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 343.84,
      "end": 353.17,
      "narration": ""
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 353.17,
      "end": 357.73,
      "narration": "二十三记发球直接得分，杭州写下第二十四冠。"
    },
    {
      "source": "compiled_master",
      "start": 357.73,
      "end": 358.0,
      "narration": ""
    }
  ]
}
